&lt;h3 class=&quot;has-heading-4-font-size wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Comprehensive wellness&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;In addition to the clinical and administrative facilities, the campus includes a comprehensive wellness center. This includes a gymnasium, fitness center with walking track, fitness studios, and a teaching kitchen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Rooftop solar panels, a tight building envelope, and high performance mechanical systems advance the client&rsquo;s sustainability goals. During planning, massing and materials were selected to integrate the facility into the surroundings, minimize negative environmental impact, and conserve natural resources.&lt;/p&gt;

