&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition:&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash;&ndash; List any awards received &ndash;&ndash;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;has-heading-4-font-size wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Improving flow and efficiency&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;The Pediatrics waiting area is designed for family clusters and active children, including a &ldquo;digital aquarium&rdquo; and reading area. Sick children will be taken directly to an exam room rather than be isolated in a separate waiting area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;The program includes groupings of 6 exam rooms for well children and four exam rooms for sick children; a team room and workspaces for 5 providers, 6 medical assistants and 6 secretaries, with support spaces.&lt;/p&gt;

