&lt;h3 class=&quot;has-heading-4-font-size wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Improved Security&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;In addition to the Inpatient Stabilization Unit, Harriman was charged with developing a plan to improve the security at the front entrance of the hospital which includes a state police station, which provides security for the entire State of New Hampshire business campus in addition to the hospital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Harriman developed a secure entrance to control visitor access and prevent elopement, expanded the police station and established control points through the public lobby area to improve security. Ballistics grade wall construction and glazing secure the police station and entrance vestibule.&lt;/p&gt;

