&lt;h3 class=&quot;has-heading-4-font-size wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Building for community and efficiency&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;This building was designed to qualify for Efficiency Maine&rsquo;s Advanced Buildings program. The program promotes energy efficiency through integrated design strategies and rigorous compliance, verification, and commissioning processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Systems contributing to the successful design included air to air heat pumps, high efficiency condensing boilers, LED lighting systems, and strategic, daylight-enhancing fenestration design. The Community Center&rsquo;s overall efficiency exceeds a baseline, code-compliant model by 25%.&lt;/p&gt;

