&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;The Yarmouth School Department engaged Harriman to undertake a space utilization study and strategic facilities plan, aimed at:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list &quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessing and documenting the condition of their facilities:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing enrollment projections;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing educational and program goals; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distilling options and recommendations for the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Those options included recommendations for repairs and replacements at each of the Department&rsquo;s four schools, as well as potential expansion options for the rapidly growing town.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

