&lt;h3 class=&quot;has-heading-4-font-size wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Changing occupancy patterns demanded a new workplace strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Taking into account that many staff members work off site, work from home, or are in the office only 1-3 times a week, this updated environment allows the business to accommodate all staff should they come into the office on any given day or provide flex space for lighter staffed days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;All workstations feature a sit-to-stand platform and the ability to reconfigure the layout as project teams flex and move about. Additionally, the removal of tall panels floods the floor with natural light deep into the space.&lt;/p&gt;

