&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;The school features a full-size gymnasium, cafeteria, stage, art and music rooms, offices, library, STEM and computer labs. The school also features space for a garden lab, home of a new organic teaching garden integrated into the school&rsquo;s curriculum, culture, and food program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Modern building systems and geothermal heating and cooling yield annual energy cost savings of more than $90,000.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Large expanses of glass and skylights flood the space with natural light and provide easy access to the outdoors, helping to cultivate a healthy and welcoming learning environment.&lt;/p&gt;

