&lt;p class=&quot;has-paragraph-md-font-size wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.harriman.com/about/people/mark-d-lee-aia-leed-ap/&quot;&gt;Mark Lee, AIA, LEED AP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.harriman.com/about/people/leadershipleadershipwilliam-h-g-gatchell-aia-ncarb/&quot;&gt;Will Gatchell, AIA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
