&lt;h6 class=&quot;wp-block-heading &quot;&gt;Type&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;has-paragraph-md-font-size wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Expansion &amp; Renovation&lt;/p&gt;
