&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition:&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash;&ndash; List any awards received &ndash;&ndash;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading  has-heading-4-font-size&quot;&gt;Building Foundations for Learning and Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;Early childhood education is a critical cornerstone for both children and communities. The expanded and enhanced daycare facilities at the Katahdin Higher Education Center supports families, students and help to attract and retain local employers, strengthening the community as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;wp-block-spacer &quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading  has-heading-4-font-size&quot;&gt;A Thoughtful, Contextual Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wp-block-paragraph&quot;&gt;The project nearly doubles the EMCC childcare program&rsquo;s capacity with a 2,300-square-foot addition. The building&rsquo;s form, materials, and orientation respond to the surrounding forests and mountains, creating a warm and inviting environment for children. Ample natural light, scaled thoughtfully for young users, floods classrooms and common spaces, seamlessly uniting the space with the outdoors. A double-height connector with a light monitor serves as a central gathering space, fostering a sense of openness and community.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Following a devastating fire, the owners of Hunter&rsquo;s Shop &lsquo;n Save seized the opportunity to rebuild better and engaged Harriman to design a welcoming and efficient new building to serve this tight-knit resort community on the bank of Lake Winnipesaukee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The new building makes better use of the tight site by repositioning the main entrance for safer pedestrian access and improved traffic flow. Underutilized outdoor space was reclaimed to add 3,000 sq. ft. of finished space, a 25% increase over the previous building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eye-catching super graphics extend Hunter&rsquo;s Shop &lsquo;n Save&rsquo;s brand attributes throughout the building, energizing interiors and easing wayfinding.&lt;/p&gt;

